      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Introduction"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Atoms are made up of three types of "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "subatomic particles",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ": protons, neutrons, and electrons. Each particle has its own mass and charge, and understanding these properties is essential for understanding atomic structure and chemical behaviour."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
